      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──之后优秀素质带着我\n在商店街到处逛，\n顺利地买到我要的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9211edaabed4d60ea135cee62ddba0a00c344ff140887518ec5d94672e09fc91",
